  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You reach into the deepest biological layer of a creature and rewrite its fundamental nature. Choose: change the creature's creature type (humanoid to plant, beast to undead, etc.); permanently alter its ability score array (reduce two scores by 4, increase two scores by 4); grant or remove immunity to one damage type; or change the creature's language from any list to any list. On a failed save, the creature does not perceive itself as changed until it attempts to use an altered ability.</p>",
